The complete list, with paths, is in JUCE/LICENSE.md.

AURA links juce_audio_utils, juce_audio_processors, juce_dsp, juce_gui_basics and
juce_gui_extra, so the libraries behind juce_opengl, juce_box2d and
juce_javascript are not compiled in.

VST is a registered trademark of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH.

Font Awesome Free is CC BY 4.0, which makes attribution a condition of use
rather than a courtesy. It is given here, in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES, in the README,
and in the plugin's own About window.

